1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,680
Wait a minute-- a child?

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,890
(Leonard:)You never see this girl.

3
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:04,860
(Leonard:)You just e-mail
and text and Twitter.

4
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,910
(Leonard:)Now you're considering
having a baby?

5
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:09,630
(Sheldon:)Amy pointed out
that between the two of us,

6
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,570
(Sheldon:)our genetic material
has the potential

7
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,700
(Sheldon:)of producing the first in a line

8
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:16,420
(Sheldon:)of intellectually superior,
benign overlords

9
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:19,690
(Sheldon:)to guide humanity
to a brighter tomorrow.

10
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,880
(Howard:)I'm guessing
that future historians

11
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,900
(Howard:)will condemn us
for not taking

12
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,120
(Howard:)this opportunity
to kill Sheldon.

13
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:30,200
(Penny:)Okay, I have
a question.

14
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,490
(Sheldon:)Yes, Penny.

15
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:33,410
(Penny:)You don't even like people
touching you.

16
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:35,130
(Penny:)How are you going to have sex?

17
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,880
(Sheldon:)Why on Earth would we have sex?

18
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,670
(Penny:)Oh, honey, did your mom
not have the talk with you?

19
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:47,170
(Penny:)You know, when your
private parts started growing?

20
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:50,260
(Sheldon:)I'm quite aware of the way
humans usually reproduce,

21
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,430
(Sheldon:)which is messy,
unsanitary,

22
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:54,760
(Sheldon:)and based on living next
to you for three years,

23
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:58,680
(Sheldon:)involves loud and unnecessary
appeals to a deity.

24
00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,820
(Penny:)Oh, God.

25
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:04,020
(Sheldon:)Yes, exactly.

